    "CoiStatement": "CONFLICTS OF INTEREST Sheng-Kai Liang has received honoraria for speeches from Pfizer and Boehringer Ingelheim, and Jen-Chung Ko has received honoraria for speeches from Boehringer Ingelheim, AstraZeneca, and Roche, and Jin-Yuan Shih has received speaking honoraria from AstraZeneca, Roche, Pfizer, Boehringer Ingelheim, Merck Sharp & Dohme, and Eli Lilly.",
